    "detailed_description": "<strong>WARNING</strong> : This is an <strong>NTR</strong> game!<br><br>The story is set in the modern world but with some medieval fantasy elements weave into it. The main character (the player will pick a name for him) is a farmer in his late 20s living alone in the country side. He inherited the farm from his father and has been living off of it ever since he got out of university.<br>One night he found a mysterious unconscious girl wearing armor on his farm (lucky guy). <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755790/extras/757973ab3f2de083eec6a64d7dad39c1.avif?t=1727924149\" width=620 height=350 /></span><br>She claim that her name is Celes and she's a knight that come from another world. She has no knowledge of this world and have nowhere to go. The MC offered to take her in. They start living together and develop a deep emotional connection.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755790/extras/71de929baa9f90ab284aabfb157ca99b.avif?t=1727924149\" width=620 height=350 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755790/extras/9716c98f2044f534f1f493b5ceaf97c7.avif?t=1727924149\" width=620 height=350 /></span><br>But farming alone isnt exactly the most profitable business in this day and age, and MC want to eventually move to the big city to pursue a different career, and to show Celes a world beyond his small isolated farm, a world of corruption and temptation...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755790/extras/bc8e3d169c474197315ade6b3164504b.avif?t=1727924149\" width=620 height=350 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755790/extras/e09bd57a9d1b28c1373afe8640fd9fc9.avif?t=1727924149\" width=620 height=350 /></span><br>Could our main character protect her from the corruption of this world ?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755790/extras/4b1b794de037fb56637016823da7fd64.avif?t=1727924149\" width=620 height=350 /></span><br>Esoterika is a choice-driven adult Visual Novel featuring multiple <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An intriguing narrative<br></li><li> Multiple characters/love interests<br></li><li> Choices driven gameplay with a point based system<br></li><li> Multiple endings<br></li><li> Explore a wide varieties of mature theme like sexual domination, submission and/or humiliation, cheating/swinging and/or interracial.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755790/extras/8b91f5c517b1ae902128b1819fd06040.avif?t=1727924149\" width=620 height=350 /></span>",
